        <mxCell id="legend_69" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;🔑 = Primary Key &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; ↳ = Foreign Key&lt;br&gt;Crow's foot: —&amp;#124;&amp;lt; mandatory many-to-one, —o&amp;lt; optional many-to-one&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Dashed box / dashed edge&lt;/b&gt; = cross-schema reference into a Core module (CRM, SCHEDULE) — LEGAL depends on Core, never the reverse.&lt;br&gt;Domain clusters colored per DESIGN.md &quot;Ink &amp;amp; Signal&quot; tokens." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#DEE3E8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
